          "$type": "ShaderFX",
          "$id": "fx0",
          "active": true,
          "code": "// @whimtex-effect Samples/Bubble Highlight\r\n// @control(_Opacity)\r\n// @param hidden float _Opacity = 1 [0 .. 1]\r\n// @param point _Center = (0.292, 0.633)\r\n// @param float _Size = 0.029 [0.005 .. 0.15]\r\n// @param float _Halo = 0.25 [0 .. 1]\r\n\r\nfloat4 ApplyFX(float2 uv,float4 color){\r\n    float d=length(uv-_Center)/max(_Size,.001);\r\n    float core=exp(-pow(d,4)*1.5);\r\n    float halo=exp(-d*d*.32)*_Halo;\r\n    float clip=1-smoothstep(.382,.390,length(uv-.5));\r\n    return float4(1,1,1,saturate(core+halo)*_Opacity*clip);\r\n}\r\n",
